window.products.push({"id":345016,"name":"ALVBELLS Welcome Sign for Front Door Decor, Double-Sided Gnome Interchangeable Welcome Sign,Seasonal Front Door Wreaths for Christmas Decorations/Hous","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81n9QKBl26L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏡【Double-Sided Design]】 Gnome welcome sign for front porch is designed with exquisite double-sided patterns. One side is farmhouse decor style with \"welcome to our home\" printed, ideal for housewarming gifts.The other is Christmas festival style, with \"home sweet gnome\" printed, suitable for Christmas decorations, Halloween decorations and other holiday decorations. Buying one welcome home sign, you can get two welcome door sign in different styles, whenever you need by easily turning over it. 🏡【Excellent Material】 Interchangeable welcome sign for front door decor, gnome door sign is made of high quality rustic round wood, giving person the beautiful enjoyment. Equipped with artificial green plants, berries decor and the classic burlap buffalo bow, which is glued by professional non-toxic hot melt adhesive on the interchangeable home sign, the welcome wreath for front door decor is waterproof and very durable, standing the test of time. Do not fade.Can withstand sunlight and rain. 🏡【Wide Application】 Welcome to our home sign with interchangeable holiday, front door wreath comes with 14 interchangeable ornaments with ultra-strong magnets. You can easily change the seasonal welcome sign interchangeable to welcome the new holidays or spring, summer, autumn and winter. It's applicable to most festivals as Christmas decorations, Halloween decorations, Thanksgiving decorations for home, 4th of July decorations, Valentine's day Decorations, making every festival unique. 🏡【Perfect Size & Ideal Gift】 Our interchangeable door sign is made of pine wood thick up to 0.35 inch and the diameter is 11.6 inch, which is thicker and more durable than others in the market, reused for a long time, without scratches and paint peeling off. The front door welcome sign is beautiful, meeting the needs front door decorations, wall decorations and farmhouse decor. Each interchangeable welcome sign is handmade, perfect as a great gift for a new homeowner, friends and church. 🏡【100% Customer experience】 Our welcome porch sign is equipped with 2 hooks and 14 interchangeable ornaments which provide 14 holiday styles for you to switch, carefully designed and packaged before shipment. One product can meet the decoration needs of the whole year. We provide 7 days no-reason return and refund service. If you are not completely satisfied with your purchase, please feel free to contact us, we will give you a satisfactory answer within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81n9QKBl26L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALVBELLS","source_asin":"B09C8YRSNM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345016","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C8YRSNM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C8YRSNM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
