window.products.push({"id":345057,"name":"Blackout Cordless Window Roller Shades, White Custom Window Shades Elegant Window Blinds, Energy Saving UV Protection Roller Shade for Windows, Doors,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317evbKRZRL._AC_.jpg","description":"MOUNT TYPES: Inside mounted shades will have a deduction taken of approximately 1/4\" to ensure a proper fit inside the window frame.Inside mounted shades require a minimum frame depth of 2inch for secure installation. If your window frame depth is less than 2inch please select outside mount.Outside mounted shades should be ordered with the exact width of the area you wish to cover. Outside mounts are often used when there is not sufficient frame depth for inside mounting.Our shades come with all mounting hardware, and mounting hardware for both inside mount and outside mount INSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the inside frame width at three locations-the top,middle,and bottom. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use that number as your inside width when ordering. Step 2. Measure the height at 3 locations-the left,middle,and right side. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use the number as your inside width when ordering. OUTSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the outside frame width adding 3-6inch to be the outside mount width. Step 2. Measure the outside frame length adding 4-6inch to be the outside mount length. The overlap it recommended to allow appropriate coverage and avoid any light gaps. Type: Roller Shades, Window Blinds Feature: Block Light & UV, Keep Warm Material: Fabric/Polyester Installation: All Mounting Hardware Included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317evbKRZRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUAKY","source_asin":"B0BZT66WPY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZT66WPY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZT66WPY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":345058,"name":"Mayshion Transparent Wine Bottle Stopper & Air Vacuum Pump Sealer Feature. [All in 1] Creates a Vacuum Tight Seal to Keep Wine Fresh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Q29hSvaOL._AC_.jpg","description":"Did you know? As soon as you uncork a bottle of wine, air begins the oxidization process. This process makes the wine lose complexities and aromas. This ruins the original flavors, destroys the alcohol content and turns the wine to a lesser attractive, acidic-vinegary taste! This All-in-one wine bottle Sealer & and built in vacuum preserver Pump, Will remove virtually all the air from the wine bottle. Operation is incredibly simple - insert the stopper and push it down as far as it goes tightly inside the bottle, and pull the top lever up and down, to pump the air out until you feel some resistance, and your Done! Wine Saver vacuum pump will extract the air from an opened wine bottle. This slows down the oxidation process and keeps the wine fresh for 7-10 days. The wine vacuum pump stopper all-in-one combination is small, handy, efficient, and cost effective way to preserve your favorite wines. Product Features: Exquisite design and appearance.Pump and stopper in one. Conform to normal wine bottle.  Keep the fresh about 7 days for the leftover wine  Perfectly engineered silicone pump securely fit stoppers and completely seal your bottles.  Takes only a few pumping motion for perfect air extraction.  No-mess, airtight sealed stoppers for fridge or wine racks storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Q29hSvaOL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mayshion","source_asin":"B00VAKKQEO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345058","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VAKKQEO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VAKKQEO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
