window.products.push({"id":345237,"name":"Cool Everyday Shoulder Bag For Women (Darkgrey/Black) | Insulated Neoprene | Works Great As Baby Diaper Bag, Shopping, Beach, Swim Or Lunch Bag | Cool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XIXqFKlRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COOL MODERN DESIGN - Enjoy the convenience and good looks of this fashionable, insulating, lightweight, yet heavy-duty day bag. Manufactured using the toughest neoprene material on the market, making it highly resistant to water, tearing and ripping. SUPER CAPACITY - At 16” x 6” x 10” (LxWxH) it can easily carry your beach towels, diapers, lunch, snacks, food, groceries from whole foods, magazines, ipad and a whole lot more! Featuring one big compartment and one big internal pockets for easy access to sunscreen, keys, phone, sunglasses, soda cans or baby bottles. UNIQUE DESIGN - With the extra thick 5 mm neoprene material, soft padded handles for added comfort and a shoulder strap it's perfect for a day at the beach, BBQ’s, pool, park, picnics, camping, vacation, road trips, festivals, or shopping trips and family days out. When done throw it in the washer if needed for easy cleaning. RE-ENFORCED STITCHING THROUGHOUT - Giving you piece of mind. Our deluxe, stylish multifunctional neoprene bags are both attractive to look at, lightweight and yet very strong. So they won't let you down and will last for several years. SUPERIOR QUALITY ASSURED - We use top quality materials such as 5 mm neoprene, YKK zippers and 8 needle double stitching for lasting capabilities. Makes a perfect gift for mum, buy with confidence today and enjoy our world class customer service. If there is ever a problem, we will help you out. Optional lifetime warranty for any manufacturer defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XIXqFKlRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nordic By Nature","source_asin":"B077XTVGPV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077XTVGPV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077XTVGPV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
