window.products.push({"id":345350,"name":"Harley’s Cake Strips Easy Bake Oven Accessories I PACK OF 2 - Even Baking Strips for Cake Pans I 48” Long & 1.75” Wide Adjustable Hook and Loop Fasten","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yXdLUoXQL._AC_SL1142_.jpg","description":"Looking for a perfect cake? Wondering how the experts bake moist, level cakes with no crowns, cracks, or dry & crusty edges? Edges bake more rapidly while the center tends to dome, crack, or rise quickly before collapsing. Harley’s bake strip is long, flexible, and adaptable thanks to the hook and loop fastener feature that also ensures the strip is fixed securely to straight-walled cake pans. (Pie dishes and similar vessels with narrowing bottoms may have a looser fit.) Practically magical hook and loop fastener strips designed to correct and fix irregular & uneven baking by securing the strips around the outside of the cake pan. EVEN BAKE CAKE STRIPS ARE THE SECRET! Make the perfect, flat-topped cake that you’ve been longing for. Harley’s cake strips for even-baking are designed to bake moist, level cakes with no crowns, splits, high-rise centers, and overdone edges. Cake strips are going to fix the high rise in the center and prevent edges that get over-baked and dry. These fabric bands insulate the sides of your cake pan so that your batter cooks evenly throughout. Please note that with the cake strips it typically requires extra baking time, but be assured the results will save you time from trying to salvage a dry, uneven cake. EXPERIENCE THE BEST OF BAKING WITH HARLEY’S! Easy Steps to Use: ✔️ Soak the strips for at least 5 minutes in water before use, then wring out excess water. Keep the strips as saturated as possible. ✔️ Adjust the strips appropriately on the pan sides by affixing opposing hook and loop sides to create a snug fit. ✔️ Allow the cake to cool for at least 10 minutes before removing the strip(s) and the cake(s) from the pan(s). FEATURES Package Includes: 2 x Bake Even Strips Super Absorbent Cotton Hook and Loop Fastener Anti-Deformation 48” long, 1.75” Wide PERFECTLY LEVEL AND DELICIOUSLY MOIST CAKES—EVERY TIME!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yXdLUoXQL._AC_SL1142_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Harley's","source_asin":"B08BFCQ9S5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345350","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BFCQ9S5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BFCQ9S5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
