window.products.push({"id":345391,"name":"Chakra Smudge Kit Plus Lavender Gift Set with 7 Crystals Selenite & Full Directions","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SPbGqOrBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Chakra smudge kit Plus Lavender Gift Set with 7 Crystals selenite & Full Directions SET INCLUDES: Made in the USA. Sage N Smudge TM Chakra smudging kits plus Lavender Gift Set includes: 1 set of 7 chakra crystals, size range from 1/2\" to 1\", 1 each of Amethyst, Sodalite, Blue Quartz, Green Aventurine, Citrine, Carnelian and Red Jasper crystal polished stones. 1 Selenite Crystal. 1 Plush Carry Bag. 1 Abalone shell, 5 to 7 inches in length. Abalone shells are the preferred shell for smudging by many peoples for thousands of years, they are the perfect size, have a rough exterior, a pearlized interior and natural breather holes on one side. 1 mini white sage stick. 1 mini lavender and white sage stick. 1 Package of Golden Aura Incense. Incense or Lavender stick: The Mystic Temple Incense can be burned at any time before or during the session. Just place a little bit of the Golden Aura incense on the abalone shell place on the shell stand and light one side of the incense with a match or lighter. (a teaspoon is great to use as an incense scooper). This is great incense for meditation also. Lavender stick may be used at any time to set the mood for healing and calmness or for meditation. 1 feather, to help waft the smoke 1 Wooden Shell Stand1 Quick reference Guide. 1 Gift Card 1 set of smudging and chakra directions. Comes as a boxed set. All content contained herein are copy right protected and property of Sage N Smudge TM. No unauthorized use of any picture or content is allowed without written approval from Sage N Smudge . Item made, sold and shipped by Sage N Smudge","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SPbGqOrBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sage N Smudge","source_asin":"B01AWNNR18","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345391","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AWNNR18","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AWNNR18","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":345392,"name":"Simple Standing Pink Flamingo Cookie Cutter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T86oX3dCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a treat for a beach party? Why not bake up a batch of flamingo cookies! Don't feel like baking ~ these make great gifts too. Who wouldn't love a flamingo bird cookie cutter from a friend! Each cookie cutter is hand crafted in our workshop from heavy weight solid copper. This cookie cutter is built to last for many generations of cookie baking, fondant cutting, ornament making, or even use it for tracing quilt patterns. Made from very heavy weight copper to maintain shape while using and storing. Great for gift giving or as a centerpiece to a cookie bouquet! Each one is slightly different from the next as they are formed one at a time and hand soldered using lead-free silver solder. Listing is for one cookie cutter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T86oX3dCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Fussy Pup","source_asin":"B01GGB36BG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GGB36BG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GGB36BG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":345393,"name":"AllTek Outdoor Wall Mount Bracket for Mini Split Ductless Air Conditioner Heavy Duty Mounting Foldable Bracket Support 9000 to 12000 BTU Up to 220 LBS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.73,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hSCZI8D4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This mini split Wall Mounting Bracket is the perfect solution for securely mounting your outdoor air conditioner unit. Constructed of heavy-duty steel, this bracket is built to last and can support up to 220 lbs. The included mounting hardware makes installation simple and easy. The multi-directional design allows for vertical or horizontal mounting and features adjustable arms for precise alignment. The bracket also features pre-drilled mounting holes for easy installation and fits mini split units up to 36” wide. This bracket is the ideal choice for safely and securely mounting your mini split air conditioner.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hSCZI8D4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AllTek","source_asin":"B08GDZCPYL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GDZCPYL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GDZCPYL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
