window.products.push({"id":345408,"name":"Enesco Jim Shore Country Living Dog in Wagon Figurine, 5.55 H, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BTqQrwBOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Jim Shore's hand-carved Heartwood Creek collection imparts a sense of hope and nostalgia, embracing inspiring themes of family, tradition, spirituality and patriotism. His designs are inspired by the time honored motifs of handcrafted folk art. Panting delightfully from a red wagon, this festive Jim Shore dog goes for a holiday ride. He shares a seat with a selection of gloriously wrapped presents. Decorated in garland and bells, this wagon brings tidings of joy and barks this season. About Us: Enesco is committed to BRING JOY EVERY DAY. The premier global destination for high-quality giftware, and home decor, our prestigious family of brands includes: Department 56 Village, Things Remembered, Foundations, Jim Shore Heartwood Creek, Disney Traditions by Jim Shore, Disney Showcase Collection, Disney by Britto, Designs by Lolita, Our Name is Mud, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BTqQrwBOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enesco","source_asin":"B083SJKCD6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083SJKCD6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083SJKCD6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
