window.products.push({"id":345515,"name":"Ailsan Memory Foam Non Slip Bath Mat Anti Slip Bathroom Bath Rug Floor Rug with Water Absorbent Soft Microfibers Shower Rug (20x31.5 Inch+20x31.5 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fSvR0WYEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"After a morning shower,you can use the memory foam bathroom mat to keep your feet comfortable and relieve fatigue or relieve foot pressure The solid color of the rug helps to transform your bath space into a spa-like oasis.Place this rectangle tufted bath rug in front of your bathroom sink to provide lavish feel under your feet.A stylish 20x 31.5 inch bath mat with a soft non-slip design and an absorbing memory foam core.Its non-slip surface maximizes user safety after a bath or shower.The sleek minimalist solid bath mat is a striking bathroom accessory Foam Bath Mat Feature Memory cotton mats are durable and long lasting Absorbent bath mat is washable breathable and heat resistant Non-slip and waterproof bath rugs'backing can securely hold the mat in place Soft touch bath rugs for bathroom protect the floor from spots and scratches Solid color bath shower mat complements the various bathroom decorations High density memory foam mat can cushion your feet and provides support for tired legs with soft feeling","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fSvR0WYEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ailsan","source_asin":"B07Z9YNHPT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345515","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z9YNHPT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z9YNHPT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":345516,"name":"All-Clad Master Chef 2 13-Inch Braiser Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/315XJAYQFYL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com The second generation of All-Clad's Master Chef line (MC2), this cookware combines brushed aluminum with stainless-steel accents for a contemporary look. Like All-Clad's other renowned cookware collections, Master Chef provides serious and professional cooks with all the virtues that make All-Clad's worldwide reputation unsurpassed. Key to its high performance is a three-ply, bonded construction. Sandwiched between the exterior and an 18/10 stainless-steel interior is a thick aluminum core that spreads heat evenly across the bottom of the pan and all the way up its sides. The interior is highly polished so it's stick- as well as corrosion-resistant. Handles, rivets, and tight-fitting lids are all gleaming stainless steel. This beautiful, round braising pan illustrates the Master Chef line's stylish yet practical design. It's 13 inches in diameter and 2-1/4 inches deep and its domed lid makes it perfect for braising on the stovetop or in the oven. Without the lid, it's equally perfect for baking cherry cobbler, roasting quail, or browning cheese sauce on asparagus and then serving it at the table. Its polished 18/10 stainless-steel handles are riveted to the pan for strength, stay cool on the stovetop, and won't be harmed by an oven's highest heat. Master Chef cookware carries a lifetime warranty against defects and should be hand washed. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/315XJAYQFYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"All-Clad","source_asin":"B00005AL53","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005AL53","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005AL53","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
