window.products.push({"id":345594,"name":"Eyes of India Decorative Block Print Boho Throw Pillow Cover, Bohemian Cushion Case for Sofa Couch, Handmade Accent Bedroom Living Room, 20x20 inch (5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+Hdhjtt+L._AC_.jpg","description":"Beautiful and stunning dhurrie rug pillows overflowing with vibrant shapes and designs.  Artisans use the block print technique to stamp patterns onto the fabric, which is strong and bold.  Made from the same thick, durable material as our dhurrie cotton rugs.  All covers feature zippers on the back.  Complement perfectly with our dhurrie cotto rugs. Reverse: Solid color with zipper closure Color: White Size: 20 X 20 in. (50 X 50 cm) Material: 100% Cotton Weight: 0.375 Kg ( 13.22 Ounce ) Place of Origin: Rajasthan - India Care: Dry cleaning only Note: Cover only; insert not included","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+Hdhjtt+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eyes of India","source_asin":"B09G9F16S2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G9F16S2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G9F16S2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":345595,"name":"Ticktime Cube Pomodoro Timer, Productivity Timer, Pause & Resume, Mute, Vibration & Adjustable Sound Alert, for Task, Work, ADHD, ADD, Meeting, 1/3/5/","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JzM-BS+OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Super Easy to Use. Flip to Start the Countdown. The pomodoro timer has 4 preset times countdown(1/3/5/10 minutes) which are activated by flipping the timer over, with the number facing up. It also has extra 60/15/25/45 minutes countdown (long press the fingerprint icon on the side of number). Additionally, you can easily set custom countdown time by pressing the two buttons. Change the way you manage your time, and make every minute count. Multiple Timing Modes. The cube timer offers countdown, count-up, and pomodoro modes. Apart from the 8 preset countdown and custom countdown, you can start count-up mode by placing the timer bottom up, and stop it by standing the screen up. Pomodoro mode is activated by long-pressing the fingerprint icon on the side of number 5. The timer notifies you every 25 minutes of work and a 5-minute break, to keep you focused and productive. The timer range is 00:01 to 99:59. Easy timer setup for maximum comfort. Suitable for Various Scenarios. The digital timer is a perfect tool for office, work, meetings, kids, study, reading, workout, cooking, and more. Needless to say, this timer can be used in thousands of scenarios! Pause & Resume, Mute. Vibration & Adjustable Sound Alert. Simply flip the timer adhd over to the front screen to pause the countdown. To resume the countdown, just flip it again. Of course, you can also pause or resume the timer by pressing the on/off button. Set the sound to your desired level of volume, and choose from mute, vibration, and adjustable sound alert. More options, more convenience. Compact, Magnetic & Rechargeable. The rechargeable timer size is 1.7*1.7*1.7inch, fits in the palm of your hand, and weighs only 1.9oz. It's portable and fits in any pocket or bag. The timer has a magnetic base that can attach to the fridge or any metal surface, freeing your hands while tracking time. It is rech-arge-able, with a durable lithium battery and USB-C charging port, saving you the extra cost of buying batteries and making a step towards environmental protection. Important Charging & Usage Notes. This timer quiet cannot be used while charging and is not waterproof. Please charge for 12 hours before first use and 4 hours for subsequent uses. When charging complete, unplug the charging cable and press on/off button to turn on the timer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JzM-BS+OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ticktime","source_asin":"B0C3R24964","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345595","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3R24964","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3R24964","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
