window.products.push({"id":345606,"name":"Zulay 2 Pack Large Insulated Bag - Reusable Heavy Duty Insulated Food Delivery Bag With Longer Handles & Reinforced Bottom - Collapsible Insulated Gro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91OkL7AxBdL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Non-woven Fabric Mesh lining Hand Wash Only Experience Shopping Convenience: Gone are the days where you have to rush from the supermarket to your home just to keep your frozen groceries from thawing in the backseat of your car. The Zulay Kitchen Insulated Shopping Bag ensures that food will stay at the right temperature for hours, whether it’s hot or cold, thanks to its integrated thermal insulation interior. The set includes 2 spacious shopping bags. Perfect for your grocery runs and family picnics. Heavy Duty Construction: Make your next shopping experience convenient and worry-free. Made of premium quality non-woven fabric, these insulated bags are strong yet lightweight and can hold up to 45 lbs. It features durable sidewalls for the bag to stand upright, convenient for loading and unloading. Its base-extended handles provide extra-strength making it suitable for large items or multiple small items. Multi-Purpose & Functional: This insulated shopping bag is just what you need to store hot food, cold drinks, fruits, vegetables,and frozen meat when you’re out buying groceries or on the go. It also serves as an insulated cooler bag, shopping bag, storage basket, picnic bag, and beach bag. The dual sliding steel zippers are easy to open and seal, keeping food and drinks fresh for hours. It now comes with improved & longer handle straps for better handling and carrying. Easy To Clean & Store: Its foldable & collapsible design makes it travel-friendly and easy to carry wherever you go. When not in use, these insulated grocery bags can be folded and collapsed, saving you space and making it easy to store. For cleaning, you can simply wipe the inside or hand wash it. No Hassle, Zulay Guarantee: We love and take pride in our Insulated Shopping Bags and we back this up with a lifetime guarantee. If there are ever any issues, just contact us and we will make it right. Order now and be assured that this product will live up to your expectations, guaranteed. If it does not, we’ve got you covered (even after the Amazon return window). Chances are, you will never need to reach out!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91OkL7AxBdL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zulay Kitchen","source_asin":"B08LG5NTJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345606","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LG5NTJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LG5NTJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
