window.products.push({"id":345701,"name":"Lafhome Dehumidifier 35oz Small Dehumidifiers for Home 2200 Cubic Feet (220 sq ft) with 7 Colorful LED Light, Portable Quiet Mini Dehumidifier with Au","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QMTgzYpIL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"【High Efficient Dehumidification】The portable home dehumidifier with 35oz large capacity water tank uses special semiconductors to condense the moisture in the air into water droplets, which can effectively removes excess moisture up to 16oz(450ml) (temperature: 86°F, humidity: 80% RH) per day in areas up to 220 square feet or 2200 cubic feet. 【Colorful Lights & Auto Shut Off】This small bedroom dehumidifier has 7 different mood lights for your option(the red light will auto on when plugged in). You can choose your favorite color by simply touch the button to create a romantic atmosphere, or turn it off as needed. In order to avoid water overflow, the dehumidifier automatically shuts itself off when the tank is full, emitting 3 beeps and flashing red LED remind you to drain it. 【Portable & Space Saving】This mini dehumidifier comes with a handle design, lightweight and compact size(5.9x5.9x10) inches makes it perfectly portable and easy to place at home and anywhere you want: kitchen, bathroom, bedroom, basement, garage, closet, RV. Note: The optimal operating temperature of the dehumidifier is 59-104℉. It will not work below 41℉. 【Ultra Quiet & Powerful】 The air dehumidifier adopts Peltier technology to bring a whisper-quiet moisture removing. The latest upgraded version of this dehumidifier is completely free of any harmful substances. It provides maximum dehumidification and improves air quality energy-efficiently as it runs on 40 watts. 【Easy to Clean & Healthy】 The dehumidifier water tank can easily open and clean to bring you high-quality clean air. We recommend you clean the water tank on a regular basis to give you continuous fresh air.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QMTgzYpIL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lafhome","source_asin":"B09K7RJBT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345701","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K7RJBT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K7RJBT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
