window.products.push({"id":345792,"name":"Guzzini Look Butter Dish 7.75 x 4.75\" x 3\" , Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vhu8+kL0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Look 8-inch length butter dish in chrome, from Guzzini. Guzzini products can be found in homes, restaurants and hotels in 85 countries throughout the world. Much of this success is due to a basic quality in the company's DNA - a curiosity for innovation. A constant striving to achieve an ideal combination of practicality and aesthetic appeal has always encouraged Guzzini to explore inquisitively, both in researching new materials and finding interesting and original design concepts. The result is a vast catalog full of all types of items for the table, the kitchen and the home. They are all beautifully designed but easy to use, very familiar, inexpensive and extremely practical. Guzzini's motto is \"designed to be used\", and this is actually the case. Guzzini colanders, containers and cutlery are not designed to be kept religiously in drawers or cupboards and only brought out on special occasions. They are to be used and re-used for daily pleasure, so that every so often you suddenly realize that you have a well-designed item in your home that makes daily living a little easier. Therefore, Guzzini's research is aimed at quality of daily life, making every moment of the day special. This quality of life also includes an appropriate relationship between the items with which we surround ourselves and their impact on the environment. Fratelli Guzzini are dedicating much effort in this regard, and will continue to do so in the future, being aware that every product should be designed keeping a sharp eye on its environmental cost. Guzzini thermoplastics can be recycled and re-used over and over again, being reborn with new shapes and colours for new uses. They become more appealing and more useful than before.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vhu8+kL0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Guzzini","source_asin":"B000VRRSOI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345792","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000VRRSOI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000VRRSOI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":345793,"name":"Stainless Steel Salt and Pepper Grinder Set of 2 - Tall salt and pepper shakers with Adjustable Coarseness - Ceramic Rotor - Peppercorn and Salt Mill ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614nFE8qwTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Premium Modern Brushed Stainless-Steel Refillable Glass Bottle Salt and Pepper Grinder Shakers Mills Set of 2 These Modern Premium Salt and pepper shakers set don't just serve a function-- they also decorate your table as your family and guests sit down to a lovely home cooked meal. ➤ MAINTAIN PEAK FRESHNESS -- Keep your spices fresh and aromatic with these Refillable Glass Salt and Pepper Grinder Set!  ➤ STYLISH AND MODERN 6 OZ TALL GLASS BODY -- These unique Premium stainless steel and tall glass bottle salt and pepper shakers mills grinder set have a simple and elegant design that will look smart on your table and charm your family and guests. Measure 7.5\" tall by 2.5\" wide, can hold 3/4 cup of spices each.  ➤ HIGH-QUALITY ADJUSTABLE CERAMIC ROTOR WITH 5 GRINDING LEVELS -- From coarse to fine, you will always have the texture you need for your dish with these shakers! Manually choose the coarseness of the seasoning from 5 options and your spices will be ground to perfection. Salt will never corrode these grinders due to the ceramic material of the rotor.  ➤ PERFECT FOR MOST TYPES OF SPICES -- Built with an UPDATED BIGGER Ceramic Rotor for grinding bigger spices such as White or Black Peppercorns, Sea Salt, Kosher Salt, Himalayan Salt, Allspice, Coriander, and more!  ➤ EASY CLEANING -- Simply unscrew the bottom glass sphere and hand wash the grinding mechanism and sphere with a mild soap.  ➤ GUARANTEED TO PLEASE -- 100% Money-Back Guarantee. If the product is defective or damaged, we will replace it for you, no questions asked! Your satisfaction is our goal! Please note: Grinders do not come filled with spices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614nFE8qwTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moderno Kitchen","source_asin":"B06ZY716LB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06ZY716LB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06ZY716LB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
