window.products.push({"id":345842,"name":"Under Bed Storage Containers Bags 2 Pack, Large Foldable Under Bed Storage Organizer Bins with 4 Handles and 2 Sturdy Zippers Oxford Cloth, Clear Wind","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vnuOz6FjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Premium Material】Our under bed storage containers are made of upgraded high-quality Oxford cloth, which is tougher than traditional non-woven fabrics and is not easy to tear, especially suitable for heavy items. The under bed storage can store blankets, quilts, clothes, shoes, toys, and other household items, and can be used for up to 10 years under normal circumstances. 【Large capacity】Considering that everyone has more clothes and thicker quilts in winter, we have prepared 2 under-bed storage bins with a size of 38.1x17x7.4 in. The large space can meet the needs of most families. The low profile under bed storage can be placed under the bed, in the cabinet, or the attic, making full use of the space at home for storage. 【Clear Window】This under-bed storage has two specifications, one is a transparent window on the side, and the other is a side and top. Therefore, we don't have to worry about the embarrassing scene of taking out everything after the low profile under bed storage is full of clothes, which makes it more convenient for us to find what we want. 【Sturdy Handle】Our handle adopts double stitching, and the needle and thread are tight. Reinforced seams have been implemented to increase the strength and prevent the handle from tearing. There is no problem whether you pull the storage bins with lids under bed from the bottom of the bed by pulling the guard handle or taking the storage bag from a high place by the handle. 【Two-way Zipper】Our under bed storage containers use a two-way stainless steel zipper, which is not easy to damage and can be used for a long time. When there are too many things in our under bed storage bins which makes the zipper difficult to close, the two-way zipper can reduce the resistance and help us close the bag.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vnuOz6FjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MINECH","source_asin":"B09MRQC768","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345842","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MRQC768","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MRQC768","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
