window.products.push({"id":345853,"name":"Anatural Tea Mug with Infuser and Lid, 16.5 OZ Tea infuser Cup, Tea Strainer Cup with Large Handle for Loose Tea, Ceramic Tea Steeping Mug, Microwave ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rvWNdivMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕ ECO-FRIENDLY MATERIALS - Made of lead-free, cadmium-free, premium natural ceramic clay, fired at high temperatures to achieve a long-lasting color and more durable. The narrow top and thick body design allows for improved temperature control to keep your drinks warm longer. A large easy-grip handle allows you to hold the cup more comfortably and stably. The Heat-insulated handle will not get hot in the microwave. ☕ BREW TEA EASILY - Enjoy the perfect cup of tea with our Tea Leaf Design infuser which consist of food-grade silicone handle and sturdy stainless steel filter. The extra fine mesh is evenly distributed, small holes allows the water to move through the tea leaves and prevent the leaves escaping. This means a better cup of tea with fewer floaties and smoother flavor. ☕ OPTIMAL 16.5-OUNCE CAPACITY - The 16.5-ounce cup is indeed just the right capacity. It looks more elegant, allowing you to enjoy the satisfaction of a delicious drink at one time. The inner surface is glib and easy to clean while the outside surface of mugs dries quickly thanks to natural materials. The mug is Dishwasher and microwave safe. (Please take out the filter before entering the microwave oven) ☕ MULTIFUNCTIONAL BAMBOO LID - The natural bamboo lid has good heat insulation function which prevents hot hands when the lid is opened. It also covering your tea seals in heat, creates a full extraction and insures the essential oils of the herbs stay in your cup. The inside of the lid has a groove design which make it works perfectly as a coaster for the infuser and holds any extra tea that may drip out for no messes. ☕ UNIQUE GLAZE - Every mug is unique because of the special reactive glaze technique, the colored glaze naturally flows down the surface of the cups, and the temperature changes during the firing process. As a result, it will be slight variation in the appearance of each piece which make the mug not only elegant but also unique. A choice of 6 stylish colors makes a great gift for holidays, birthdays and special occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rvWNdivMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anatural","source_asin":"B092753R9K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092753R9K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092753R9K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
