window.products.push({"id":345944,"name":"HARBOREST Chair Cushions for Dining Chairs 6 Pack - Memory Foam Seat Cushions for Kitchen Chairs, U-Shaped Non-Slip Chair Pads for Dining Chairs Set o","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Gni43CLeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RESTORE CHAIR CUSHIONS - These kitchen chair cushions set of 6 are vacuum packed. At normal room temperature, it takes 2-3 days for the dining chair cushions to recover to its original condition. Use the hot air mode of the hair dryer and blow on the non-slip side of the chair cushion for 3-5 minutes, use the dryer for 5-8 minutes at low temperature or 3-5 minutes at high temperature, you can quickly get the perfect chair cushion. SUPERB ANTI-SLIP - As a good kitchen chair pad, the most important thing is to ensure that the chair cushion will not move around during use. For this reason, we have selected the first-class anti-slip effect of PVC composite anti-slip fabric to ensure that it stays in place under frequent use.Make your chair a more comfortable place to be with HARBOREST chair pads. FITS PERFECTLY IN ANY CHAIR - Measure 17\" x 16\" x 1.5\",these tufted chair pads for dining chairs 6 pack are \"U\" shaped.The most conventional size and design makes it suitable for almost any dining rooms, kitchens, offices, bedrooms, play rooms or even outdoor chairs.(If you use it outdoors, please bring it back to your room in time after using it. Avoid wet weather and being wet by rain). SLOW-REBOUND MEMORY FOAM - The indoor kitchen chair cushions are filled with whole-piece of slow-rebound memory foam, which has the ability to deform slowly, extending the life of the cushions.And we glued the shell fabric and sponge together, keeping the shape of the kitchen seat cushions very well while also ensuring support. Bring comfort to your wood,iron,wicker and metal chairs with these dining room chair cushions. GOOD-LOOKING APPEARANCE, EASY CARE - A variety of colors to choose from, depending on the style of home decoration to choose dark or light colors. Enjoy the comfort and bring color updates to your dining chairs with our seat cushions for dining room chairs. The most critical point is that these chair seat cushions are MACHINE WASHABLE.Machine wash cold, do not bleach, do not iron, tumble dry and your chair cushions will look as good as new.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Gni43CLeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HARBOREST","source_asin":"B0C5QZWXW4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5QZWXW4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5QZWXW4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
