window.products.push({"id":345947,"name":"SmartDevil Portable Desk Humidifier,1.1L Cool Mist Humidifier, Small Humidifiers for Home Bedroom Office Travel, Double-Head Spray, Colorful Night Lig","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HftjFIefL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1. 【Multiple Modes Available】: There are four different modes of double atomizing humidifier, which can fully meet your needs for air humidification. You can choose the appropriate spraying mode according to your environment and space.【Note:Humidifier is recommended to use clean tap water or mineral water.Ban to use pure water or distilled water, which will cause water to accumulate in the mist outlet of the humidifier.】 2.【Wireless Use & Portable Design】：Wireless use,continuous water mist,equipped with 4000mAh high capacity battery, you can easily use it anywhere in the wireless statee. It can work wirelessly for up to 12 hours after being fully charged. Type-C USB charging port,rechargeable at any time.With a leather portable design, this portable humidifier can be easily taken to anywhere, perfect for your home,office, car or travelling use. 3.【Novel Double Mist Spray Humidifier】: This ultrasonic humidifier with double mist spray outlet design which sprays a super large mount mist for a quick humidify, keeps you away from drying. 1.1L large capacity, no need to add water frequently.Can be operated up to 13 hours with dual-mist continuous spray mode, and up to 40 hours if alternate one-mist intermittent mode. 4.【Automatic Power Failure & Water Shortage Protection】：When the water level of the water tank is lower than the water level probe in the water tank, all spray modes will be automatically turned off to eliminate safety hazards.When you leave your home without turning it off or during your sleep，you don‘t need to worry about the safety。 5.【User Friendly & Customer Service】With ultrasonic technology, the desk humidifier operates ultra quiet, no disturb your study, working or sleeping.7 colorful soft night light to meet your different needs, gives you a comfortable, warm and restful environment.Provide free online customer service. We promise to answer within 24 hours . If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we are willing to answer your questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HftjFIefL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SmartDevil","source_asin":"B083XSD23Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345947","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083XSD23Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083XSD23Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":345948,"name":"Pressed Floral Candle - Aromatherapy Candles, Long Lasting Candles, Luxury Candles, Luxury Candles Gifts (Sunlit Neroli, 21 oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51svT3dSDqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sweet jasmine and sea salt top notes combine to make a tropical beach house just in time for summer. Driftwood, frangipani, grapefruit and sea jasmine bloom into a gourmand floral accord with nuances of sun silk, aloe blossom, lavender and sheer bergamot. Crack open this small candle and be greeted by a delightful combination of Sea Jasmine, Sea Salt, Driftwood, Frangipani and Grapefruit. This striking mix, finished with a wreath of delicate Ivy, Larkspur and Maidenhair Fern, will adorn any home. It's a wonderfully nostalgic home decoration for any room of your house, from the bathroom to your kitchen and more! Sink into the warm, inviting scent of Vining Jasmine candle. This small-press candle is scented with uplifting sea jasmine, flowery driftwood, and is perfect for any aromatic sanctuary! The Vining Jasmine Pressed Floral Candle will not only allow for your space to smell divine, but will enhance your home decor too! Enjoy the sweet aroma of Jasmine as you sit by the fire. Our Vining collection features seven unique candles scented with essential oils combined with a cotton wick. The luscious fragrance of tropical flowers, sweet driftwood and sea salt wafts from this small candle. The candle is decorative and can be used in any place you like. The lid of the candle has a unique floral pattern. This 4.5 ounce candle burns for 22 hours and has a height of 2.5\" and 2.75\" diameter. Capture the essence of a warm Mediterranean summer with this Vining Jasmine Small Pressed Floral Candle! We captured the essence of this lushly textured fragrance in a rich, pressed candle. Our pressed floral candles feature dreamy floral tableaus displayed between panes of glass. Hand poured with a coconut wax blend. Add a fragrance-rich touch to your home with Vining Jasmine Small Pressed Floral Candle. This soy candle features botanicals and a blend of essential oils, including grapefruit, sea jasmine and driftwood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51svT3dSDqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rosy Rings","source_asin":"B0BYGFTBPG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-345948","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYGFTBPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYGFTBPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
